      "description": "Icon buttons, row actions and the top-bar toggle.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-g\" aria-label=\"Previous month\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></button>",
