      "description": "Rail nav; the active item takes the selected wash and indigo text.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">Dashboard</a><a href=\"#\">Expenses</a><a href=\"#\">Budgets</a><a href=\"#\">Insights</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;width:220px;padding:8px;background:var(--sidebar);border-radius:11.2px}.ds-nav a{display:block;padding:8px;border-radius:6.4px;color:var(--sidebar-foreground);font:400 14px Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;outline:none}.ds-nav a:hover{background:var(--sidebar-accent);color:var(--sidebar-accent-foreground)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--sidebar-ring)}.ds-nav a[aria-current=page]{background:var(--sidebar-accent);color:var(--primary);font-weight:500}"
